      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        82.09503936767578,
        260.98590087890625,
        98.87803649902344
      ],
      "text": "5.1 \t Daily isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.83648681640625,
        224.3997344970703,
        116.0484848022461
      ],
      "text": "6 months’ isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        119.65019989013672,
        526.6903686523438,
        132.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "Six months’ daily monotherapy with isoniazid is the standard treatment for both adults and children living in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.65020751953125,
        526.7012329101562,
        146.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "countries with either high or low TB incidence. Several systematic reviews have demonstrated its preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.65020751953125,
        526.648193359375,
        160.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "efficacy. A systematic review of RCTs involving people living with HIV   showed that isoniazid monotherapy  (17)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        161.65020751953125,
        526.6671142578125,
        174.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "reduces the overall risk for TB by 33% (RR 0.67; 95% CI 0.51;0.87), and the preventive efficacy reached 64%",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        175.65020751953125,
        526.6359252929688,
        188.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "for people with a positive TST (RR 0.36; 95% CI 0.22;0.61). Furthermore, the efficacy of the 6-month regimen",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        189.65020751953125,
        526.6030883789062,
        202.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "was not significantly different from that of 12 months’ daily isoniazid monotherapy (RR 0.58; 95% CI 0.3;1.12)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        203.65020751953125,
        526.6962280273438,
        216.4501953125
      ],
      "text": ". A recent systematic review of RCTs also showed a significantly greater reduction in TB incidence among  (17)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        217.65020751953125,
        526.6821899414062,
        230.4501953125
      ],
      "text": "participants given the 6-month regimen than in those given a placebo (odds ratio, 0.65; 95% CI 0.50;0.83)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        231.65020751953125,
        92.44609832763672,
        244.4501953125
      ],
      "text": ".  (45)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.84442138671875,
        224.3997344970703,
        271.0564270019531
      ],
      "text": "9 months’ isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.65814208984375,
        526.689453125,
        287.4581298828125
      ],
      "text": "No controlled clinical trials were found of 9 months’ versus 6 months’ isoniazid monotherapy. Re-analysis",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.65814208984375,
        526.7203369140625,
        301.4581298828125
      ],
      "text": "and modelling of the United States Public Health Service trials of isoniazid conducted in the 1950s and 1960s,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.65814208984375,
        526.6883544921875,
        315.4581298828125
      ],
      "text": "however, showed that the benefit of isoniazid increases progressively when it is given for up to 9–10 months",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.65814208984375,
        195.47608947753906,
        329.4581298828125
      ],
      "text": "and stabilizes thereafter  .  (46)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.8523254394531,
        232.57821655273438,
        356.0643310546875
      ],
      "text": "36 months’ isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.666015625,
        526.6841430664062,
        372.46600341796875
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis of three RCTs of people living with HIV in settings with high TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.666015625,
        526.7210083007812,
        386.46600341796875
      ],
      "text": "prevalence and transmission showed that continuous IPT can reduce the risk for active TB by 38% more than",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.666015625,
        526.71923828125,
        400.46600341796875
      ],
      "text": "6 months’ isoniazid  . The effect was greater in people with a positive TST (49% for active TB and 50%  (47)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.666015625,
        526.6312255859375,
        414.46600341796875
      ],
      "text": "for death). In those with a negative TST, neither effect was significant, although the point estimate indicated",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.666015625,
        220.53213500976562,
        428.46600341796875
      ],
      "text": "a reduction in TB incidence of 27%.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.62481689453125,
        355.4491271972656,
        460.4078369140625
      ],
      "text": "5.2\t Daily rifampicin plus isoniazid for 3–4 months",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.3432312011719,
        526.7001953125,
        479.1432189941406
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review   and its update in 2017   showed that the efficacy and the safety profile of 3–4  (48) (45)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85612487792969,
        480.3432312011719,
        526.6145629882812,
        493.1432189941406
      ],
      "text": "months’ daily rifampicin plus isoniazid were similar to those of 6 months’ isoniazid. The previous GDG therefore",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85612487792969,
        494.3432312011719,
        526.6751708984375,
        507.1432189941406
      ],
      "text": "concluded that daily rifampicin plus isoniazid could be used as an alternative to isoniazid in settings with low",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85612487792969,
        508.34326171875,
        526.6011962890625,
        521.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "TB incidence  . We conducted a new review to compare the effectiveness in children of rifampicin plus  (9, 10)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85613250732422,
        522.34326171875,
        526.7264404296875,
        535.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid daily for 3 months with isoniazid for 6 or 9 months. The evidence-to-decision and the GRADE tables",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        140.49415588378906,
        536.2832641601562,
        210.23516845703125,
        549.2132568359375
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85613250732422,
        536.34326171875,
        526.6532592773438,
        549.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "are presented in  . We identified one RCT and two observational studies  . The authors  (49–51)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        550.34326171875,
        526.6873168945312,
        563.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "of the RCT   reported no clinical disease in either group and used new radiographic findings suggestive  (50)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        564.34326171875,
        526.6231079101562,
        577.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "of active TB as a proxy for clinical disease. Fewer participants given daily rifampicin plus isoniazid than those",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        578.34326171875,
        526.6142578125,
        591.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "given 9 months of isoniazid developed radiographic changes (RR 0.49, 95% CI 0.32;0.76). The authors also",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        592.34326171875,
        526.6444702148438,
        605.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "reported a lower risk for adverse events (RR 0.33, 95% CI 0.20;0.56) and a higher adherence rate (RR 1.07,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        606.34326171875,
        526.6213989257812,
        619.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "95% CI 1.01;1.14) among children given daily rifampicin plus isoniazid. Similar findings were reported in the two",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85610961914062,
        620.34326171875,
        196.32611083984375,
        633.1432495117188
      ],
      "text": "observational studies  .  (49, 51)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        648.302001953125,
        354.68878173828125,
        665.0850219726562
      ],
      "text": "5.3 \t Daily rifampicin monotherapy for 3–4 months",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        671.0203247070312,
        526.6683349609375,
        683.8203125
      ],
      "text": "A previous systematic review conducted for the 2015 LTBI guidelines  , updated in 2017  , found similar  (48) (45)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86624145507812,
        685.0203247070312,
        526.6661376953125,
        697.8203125
      ],
      "text": "efficacy for 3–4 months’ daily rifampicin and 6 months of isoniazid (odds ratio, 0.78; 95% CI, 0.41;1.46). The",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86624145507812,
        699.0203247070312,
        526.6074829101562,
        711.8203125
      ],
      "text": "review also showed that individuals given rifampicin daily for 3–4 months had a lower risk for hepatotoxicity",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86624145507812,
        713.0203247070312,
        425.96630859375,
        725.8203125
      ],
      "text": "than those treated with isoniazid monotherapy (odds ratio, 0.03; 95% CI 0.00;0.48).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.313899993896484,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.68989944458008,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "24",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
